# Mojo build artifacts
*.o
*.so
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# output generated by the demos and the plotting scripts.
# `results/*` and not `results/`: with the trailing slash git does not even enter
# the directory and the exceptions below would not apply.
results/*
*.csv
!tests/golden/**/*.csv
# The comparison CSVs ARE versioned: they are the result the report rests on, and
# without them the figures can neither be reproduced nor audited.
# `bench_comparison.csv` is Milestone 4's and already carries the rows of all THREE
# legs concatenated, so it stands alone: the per-leg CSVs are intermediates.
!results/bench_spo_stoix.csv
!results/bench_comparison.csv

# editor cruft
.vscode/
.idea/

# claude-authored notes/docs kept locally for context, never committed
*.md
!tests/golden/**/*.md
!README.md
